RunInfo: Requires independent PP, PM, MP, and MM polarized pp samples.
NumEvents: 100000
NeedsCrossSection: yes
Beams: [[p+, p+]]
Energies: [[255.0, 255.0]]
Description:
  Fills every prompt photon with |eta| < 0.25. Isolation uses R=0.5 and
  requires the accepted cone energy other than the photon to be below 10% of
  its energy, with 0.2 GeV/c charged and 0.3 GeV neutral thresholds. Both
  inclusive and isolated invariant cross sections and isolated-photon
  helicity yields are provided for normalized four-helicity combination.
